{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026KMw0kufiRa1795178204.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>馬鞍山富寶花園有內部私人供水管爆裂，屋苑食水及沖廁水供應受影響。</p><p></p><p>傍晚約六時晚飯時間，不少居民帶同水桶、水袋等，到樓下水車取水，取水點出現人龍，有水務署「供水特攻隊」，及關愛隊成員協助居民。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-1830_002.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/2026TUwqUG1lsi1795179973.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>水務署指早上得悉，富寶花園有內部私人供水管爆裂，與沙田民政處、區議員等協調後，已安排臨時食水供應，除了4架水車，亦放置了24個水箱。</p><p></p><p>大廈管理處承建商，安排緊急維修。到晚上近8時，現場消息指，已完成修復水管，供水陸續恢復。</p><p></p><p><p><img alt=\"Picture_J.WATER-1830_003.jpg\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/11/20260FYduNf1hd1795179993.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/></p></p><p></p><p>富寶花園在1993年入伙，屬私人參建居屋，共有12座、超過4,000個單位。</p><p></p><p>沙田北區議員蔡惠誠說：「第7座那邊，在康傑學校那一邊、康傑幼稚園那邊。我了解都是第一次爆，都是喉管比較舊，屋苑有點年份，其實都是用久了有爆裂的情況，不是大問題。」</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:24:02.181955+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":328,"images":3,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-20T12:31:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-21T03:37:12.042241+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-20T13:17:21.646189+00:00","content_hash":"e22d8e6d9f7740005f60dfbc2faf0a576130fed3a340015c2477c112cc186b68","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-20T13:24:02.181955+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}